# Step 4 — Connect to EC2 via SSH

I connected to the EC2 instance using its Public IPv4 DNS:

```bash
ssh -i ~/Desktop/DevOps/nextwork-keypair.pem ec2-user@<YOUR_PUBLIC_IPV4_DNS>
```

After accepting the fingerprint, I successfully entered the EC2 instance.

I verified connection when the terminal changed to:

```
ec2-user@<your-instance>
```

