# Secret Mission — Edit Using nano (Terminal Editor)

To understand editing without an IDE, I navigated to the file location:

```bash
cd ~/nextwork-web-project/src/main/webapp
```

Then opened the file:

```bash
nano index.jsp
```

I added:

```html
<p>I am writing this line using nano instead of an IDE.</p>
```

Saved with:
```
Ctrl + O
```

Exited with:
```
Ctrl + X
```

